f;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="456.0" y="770.0" width="440.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="web_ui.st3" value="④ 요청 문장 + RAG 예시(같은 가구의 기본 설계 · 파생본 · 조립 결과) → GPT-4o: 튜닝(템플릿 · 숫자 → 코드가 배치) → 안 되면 자유 생성(블록 JSON)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="456.0" y="854.0" width="440.0" height="55.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="web_ui.st4" value="⑤ check_design 호출 → 실패 이유를 돌려줘 재생성(최대 2번) → 통과면 저장, 아니면 GEN_FAILED(기본 설계 권함)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="456.0" y="919.0" width="440.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="web_ui.st5" value="⑥ designs · builds 저장 · 조회 · 버전 트리(parent · 버전 +0.1) · RAG 예시 — 처음은 JSON 파일, DB 제품은 10/8 오전" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="456.0" y="1003.0" width="440.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="web_ui.st6" value="⑦ get_design 답(레시피 · 블록 JSON) · save_build 받기" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="456.0" y="1053.0" width="440.0" height="25.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="web_ui.c0" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#a8a8a8;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.000;entryY=0.300;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="web_ui.in0" target="web_ui.st0"><mxGeometry