n=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2810.0" y="770.0" width="470.0" height="25.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st3" value="④ 다음 블록을 pick_place 목표로 → 결과 → 블록마다 ②③. 공급 칸이 다 비면 WAIT_SUPPLY 알림 → [계속]" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2810.0" y="805.0" width="470.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st4" value="⑤ 스캔: observe → observe_front(→ side) 자세마다 scan_capture → scan_infer → scan_result 방송" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2810.0" y="855.0" width="470.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st5" value="⑥ 멈춤이면 STOPPED → 다시 시작 → 쥔 블록 확인 → 진행 확인부터" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2810.0" y="905.0" width="470.0" height="25.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st6" value="⑦ 관측 결과 ↔ 레시피 → 진행표(있음 · 없음 · 높이 · 오차 측정값) → progress 방송" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2810.0" y="974.0" width="470.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st7" value="⑧ 다음 블록 = sequence 첫 미배치(받침 있음) · 설계 좌표 + 조립 원점 → 로봇 좌표" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2810.0" y="1024.0" width="470.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st8" value="⑨ 블록 JSON 검사: 